# One payload, two landings. Natural landing strips waterlogged
# (PistonMovingBlockEntity.tick:309-311); finalTick (262-283) does not - so the same
# waterlogged stairs ends dry when pushed steadily and keeps its phantom water when spit.
design designs/corrupt-block-entity/scenarios/payload-waterlogged.txt
use 0 1 0
use 0 1 2
quiet 12
expect_state 3 1 0 minecraft:oak_stairs
expect_state 3 1 0 waterlogged=false
expect_state 4 1 2 minecraft:oak_stairs
expect_state 4 1 2 waterlogged=true
plane 0 -1 -3 6 3
print
plane 2 -1 -3 6 3
print
